{# lede #}A differential geometer's approach{# lede #}

Prerequisites:

1. Familiarity with Stokes' Theorem on differential Exterior Tensor Algebras of $$n$$-dimensional manifolds $$M$$.

2. Exposure to basic Riemannian Geometry, esp in local coordinates, including Einstein/PAIN Notation.

3. Interest in Smooth and Stochastic Dynamical Systems including Brownian Motion and Martingale Theory.

